message: "If you use this software, or cite the values it establishes, please cite the archived version below."
title: "MathRecords: search and verification software for mixed van der Waerden numbers"
abstract: >-
  Search and verification software for mixed van der Waerden numbers
  w(j+2; 2^j, t_1, t_2), together with the lower-bound colourings, the SAT
  refutations and the replayed DRAT proof objects that establish five new
  terms of the OEIS sequences A217005, A217007, A217058, A217059 and A217236.
  Lower bounds are explicit colourings checkable by a standard-library-only
  program that never invokes a solver; upper bounds are SAT refutations, with
  per-cube DRAT proofs replayed under drat-trim and a separate machine-checked
  proof that the cube set is exhaustive.
type: software
